{1}{[Whispering.] Please!  Help me! }{[Whispering.] Please!  Help me! }{}{}{}{}
{2}{The elves sent me...what is happening here? }{}{5}{}{4}{}
{4}{These lizard men have captured and trapped me here!  I don't know what they plan to do with me, but I don't think I want to find out...}{These lizard men have captured and trapped me here!  I don't know what they plan to do with me, but I don't think I want to find out...}{}{}{}{}
{5}{Was there a battle?  Did you provoke these creatures?}{}{5}{}{7}{}
{7}{No...I was merely hunting when they fell upon us.  They called me a murderer and a betrayer...I tried to reason with them, but they would hear nothing!  They tied me up and brought me here....please!  Get me out of this pit!}{No...I was merely hunting when they fell upon us.  They called me a murderer and a betrayer...I tried to reason with them, but they would hear nothing!  They tied me up and brought me here....please!  Get me out of this pit!}{}{}{}{}
{8}{Calm down.  They have guards posted...what do you recommend?}{}{5}{}{10}{}
{10}{If you're a mage, you may have some spells that will free me.  If not, you can get some sort of rope and I could climb out of here, but you'll have to do something about the guards...}{If you're a mage, you may have some spells that will free me.  If not, you can get some sort of rope and I could climb out of here, but you'll have to do something about the guards...}{}{}{}{}
{11}{Perhaps I'll speak with their leader, sort this out...}{}{5}{}{13}{}
{12}{It's fortunate I have some rope here right now...}{}{5}{in 5640}{-6}{}
{13}{I don't know...they seem fairly hostile towards what they call "warm-bloods"...anyone who is not a lizard such as they.  Be careful, and tread lightly...}{I don't know...they seem fairly hostile towards what they call "warm-bloods"...anyone who is not a lizard such as they.  Be careful, and tread lightly...}{}{}{}{}
{14}{I'll do that.  Hold on...I'll get you out of there, yet...}{}{5}{}{0}{lf1 1}
{16}{There you are...have you brought me some rope? }{There you are...have you brought me some rope? }{}{}{}{}
{17}{No...I don't have any...}{}{5}{ni 5640}{}{fl 21}
{18}{Yes...I found some...}{}{5}{in 5640}{-6}{}
{21}{Please hurry!  These savages are going to kill me!  I just know it!}{Please hurry!  These savages are going to kill me!  I just know it!}{}{}{}{}
{23}{Thank you, but the guards are still here...get rid of them somehow, and then come back and help me out of here...! }{Thank you, but the guards are still here...get rid of them somehow, and then come back and help me out of here...! }{}{}{}{}
{24}{I'll do so...}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{40}{Thank you so much!  And you've taken care of the guards as well!  Can you hand me the rope...?}{Thank you so much!  And you've taken care of the guards as well!  Can you hand me the rope...?}{}{}{}{}
{41}{Here you go...}{}{5}{}{-16}{}
{43}{I thank you stranger.  I'm going back to Qintarra...I recommend you do the same...}{I thank you stranger.  I'm going back to Qintarra...I recommend you do the same...}{}{}{}{}
{44}{I just might do that.  Good day to you...}{}{5}{}{-21}{}

